    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Silence. Uncover the Curse.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hunted. <br>Trapped in the isolation of the South African bush, a <i>heks</i>\u2014woven from local folklore and raw malice\u2014torments you. She whispers in the wind. Waits in the thorns. Every rustle in the grass, every crack of bone, is her call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the clues. Uncover why she chose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/3a373c28b4ac7255ead2eec5f43239b7.poster.avif?t=1750273622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/3a373c28b4ac7255ead2eec5f43239b7.webm?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/3a373c28b4ac7255ead2eec5f43239b7.mp4?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Veld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Unseen South African Horror</strong> <br>Dread steeped in real legends: cursed earth, and sins buried in the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel her secret?<br>Or become another ghost of the bush?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/d2f063742db93fee8181a6dfec746521.poster.avif?t=1750273622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/d2f063742db93fee8181a6dfec746521.webm?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/d2f063742db93fee8181a6dfec746521.mp4?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SAS: Heks</strong>, you  explore an abandoned farmhouse deep in rural South Africa. You go to the farm after receiving a distressing phone call from a close friend who vanished while staying on the farm. Armed with only a camera, you begin your descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through eerie locations and points of interest across the farmstead as you piece together the mystery of your friend\u2019s disappearance. Observe, interact, and uncover the unsettling truth hidden in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-style visuals</strong> that capture the eerie atmosphere of found-footage horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive environments and puzzles</strong> that you need to overcome to progress through the farm and find out what events took place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slow-burning horror experience</strong>, built on tension, dread, and atmosphere\u2014<i>not cheap jumpscares</i>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Silence. Uncover the Curse.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hunted. <br>Trapped in the isolation of the South African bush, a <i>heks</i>\u2014woven from local folklore and raw malice\u2014torments you. She whispers in the wind. Waits in the thorns. Every rustle in the grass, every crack of bone, is her call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the clues. Uncover why she chose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/3a373c28b4ac7255ead2eec5f43239b7.poster.avif?t=1750273622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/3a373c28b4ac7255ead2eec5f43239b7.webm?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/3a373c28b4ac7255ead2eec5f43239b7.mp4?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Veld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Unseen South African Horror</strong> <br>Dread steeped in real legends: cursed earth, and sins buried in the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel her secret?<br>Or become another ghost of the bush?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/d2f063742db93fee8181a6dfec746521.poster.avif?t=1750273622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/d2f063742db93fee8181a6dfec746521.webm?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/d2f063742db93fee8181a6dfec746521.mp4?t=1750273622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SAS: Heks</strong>, you  explore an abandoned farmhouse deep in rural South Africa. You go to the farm after receiving a distressing phone call from a close friend who vanished while staying on the farm. Armed with only a camera, you begin your descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through eerie locations and points of interest across the farmstead as you piece together the mystery of your friend\u2019s disappearance. Observe, interact, and uncover the unsettling truth hidden in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-style visuals</strong> that capture the eerie atmosphere of found-footage horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive environments and puzzles</strong> that you need to overcome to progress through the farm and find out what events took place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slow-burning horror experience</strong>, built on tension, dread, and atmosphere\u2014<i>not cheap jumpscares</i>.</p></li></ul>",
